 Preface
 ~~~~~~~
 This ARexx program is for TechnoBBS. It scans the message conferences and
 displays the number of messages and some other interesting information.


 Installation
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Move the script to BBS:Rexx directory. Add command (see the example below)
 to one of your menu files and compile the menu. You should customize the
 script before testing. Please, do not distribute any modified versions.

 Command "stats"
 {
    dos("rx >NIL: BBS:Rexx/MessageStats.rexx \(node())");
 }


